# RE-LOCK 2026-11-15 (1), e2e only, test-setup fixes after the first run (unit 14/14 unchanged). (i) The run assumed every reading of every page has in-depth text to sell; short readings (often Chinese, some English) have none, and the locked unit test (c) says then "no offer". Now: a reading without offers must have no paid block and no price at all (new check), every language must have readings with offers and at least 10 of 18 readings must (coverage); three tab-free reading pages added (astro, dream, iching; horoscope keeps its reading in a hidden tab). (ii) crisis: the first page (fixed order) with offers is used, groups are found by element, not by id (astro shows two readings with the same group ids). (iii) calm: "a read-more button exists" replaced by "no read-more part emptied or hidden" (a calm reading may have no fold; when it has one it is whole). (iv) off: the HTML snapshot waits until the page stops changing by itself (nav.js Thai line breaking). No assertion on prices, headings, visibility, crisis content or the off state removed or loosened. Product fixes in the same round: fortune-paid.js groups the reading itself when its hook runs before fortune-read.js; one offer panel per page.
